    <item nodeId="node-1016">
        <command xml:space="preserve">west</command>
        <result xml:space="preserve">DEBUG: Départ autorisé.

West Path
A dark path lined with imposing trees, where everything seems to be watching you. The branches cast disturbing shadows, as if trying to hold you back.

[Tip: Use EXAMINE to look closely at objects, and INVENTORY or I to check what you're carrying.]
&gt;</result>
